        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'ushapta",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga eaduupcheewi, adoahuuyi giinealshoodiga saang'a aba gideaba ghoanalli beadi aseaseeni anealshiin jea eanyasa girgweaksiinda haw ea ghwanaawda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba aseasa eesa sean iissa gearamwaschi gea saang'a, ama deepa ea mwaramwasta siida wassean aba ng'asheega rugu abeeda siisi ea doabiiwaat, ak ghoamu ghwarat eara saseadaanyi sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iissa iisiyiinyi ghealooniga ghuusiga faraasi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Faraasi: Diyeayda uurji digeeda.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ak abeeda gwasinneasa mureeda, abeeda geepali sasanuuka nyaawa sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ang'ula maleambajeega hees ea gwadeenacha naaha iissa ghwaat jeameeda ng'waan, iissa geasaja gidamwanang' muuchi simwanmwana ak googeal siida mwanmwan heeda wassean gasa gawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'ushapta gidamwanang' gil ak iissa ghaghwar geaw aba badayda haleanjeeda hees. Dareabeeta eara ea haw iissa ghwaak beasta mwanang'!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ng'ushapta ea beasta. Nea ng'ushapta ea gidamiidoabiiwaat gil aba jeeda fugaasa, iissa ghang'uda saseesean ririnnyeanda, iissa goong'eesa beasta haleanjeedeaba garayi, ak ghoang'eat jeeda beasta hang'weaniidooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gilinyoo ea heeluutka diyeanga gil ea dea dariidaka, ea dea diyeanga badiina ng'eanyi ea dea haleanjeeda mida jeeda basooda, geamu eefur, ak ea nigeawiit buuneeda ghoahaaghwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghanyea manda siida ammu ghoahaaghwa ng'ushapta, was munyinda mwahawda, ak ghwanyiit furooda eatu miyeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba nih geebadiischeesi Ng'utamiida was Ghweandeanya, nea aba nih iissa geamoashti buuneeda, ghayi sisin ea eegala ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba ghuutida asagiin iissa gwarina ghawooda ea mooshteayda. Fuga eaduupcheewi, ng'asheesu mwahida gideaba gaygwasnu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gheang'deenda asakalealaan ghoamu gwarina beega inya ea beega ng'weani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga eaduupcheewi, heapi shaboogheecheanda, ghoamu gwaji gulageecheanda, ghana sabiibu ghoamu gwaji shaboogheeta? Asi gwasunu eara gheang'deenda moammu gooruudu beega matawi ea gea innya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Weaghuumeeda leabu suuta shamooghuutka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nih ng'eaha aba jeedeang'wa mideawa weaghuumeeda ea fughareeda? Aba giibindaanyi miy dahiimna gadiyoojigaaschi aba garbabanda ea weaghuumeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iyoondeawi lajoodeaba ghuut ng'waan ea gasooda shidoodeaba ghaang' aba jeeda gurooruunatkeagwa, adoaghwarji geat ak ghoahuuyi ng'uyyeega aba heeda huumeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda weaghuumeeni ea maleapna heetiyeada, nih gaba badayda ng'eanyiida, ak ea maba guroorooda, ak gaba meang'nyeandeenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba heeda mida lachng'eanyiida ea gasooda shidoodeaba ghaang', gaygwanda mitagheasta ea giliwas ng'ashaan muy nyooh eesina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuku weaghuumeeda leabu heetiyeada gidamadeeda aamiy, nuut gaba weayda, ak ea garbabu, nea iissa gooleeysiit ng'asheega buuneeda, nea gwandeawa haghweega miyaas, ak ea mayamiisachi ghana gwareengani buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea haghweega doobiiwnata geehisa jeeda weayda nea gwahisa fuga sina weayda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
